/*
 * Covenant skin of the in-game UI (Synty INTERFACE - Fantasy Warrior HUD).
 * GENERATED by Krytical Nova > UI > Build Faction Skins from the Hegemony sheets: same layout, other sprites,
 * fonts and colours. It applies under the .kn-faction-covenant class, which FactionSkin puts on the UI when the
 * local player belongs to this faction. Re-run the tool after changing a base sheet.
 */

/* ---- KryticalTheme.uss ---- */
.kn-faction-covenant .kn-root {
